You are integrating three calculator components into the IVDR wiki's document system.

**Project:** `C:\Users\redna\.claude\ivdr-wiki\`
**Git root:** `C:\Users\redna\.claude\`

## Step 1: Add `CalcToolType` to `src/data/documents.ts`

Read `C:\Users\redna\.claude\ivdr-wiki\src\data\documents.ts`.

Find the `DocTemplate` interface (around line 36) and add `calcTools?: CalcToolType[]` field.
Also add the `CalcToolType` type export BEFORE the interface.

The change looks like:
```ts
export type CalcToolType = "sens-spec" | "sample-size" | "risk-matrix";

export interface DocTemplate {
  id: string;
  stationId: number;
  docTitle: string;
  // ... rest of existing fields ...
  calcTools?: CalcToolType[];  // ADD THIS at the end of the interface
}
```

## Step 2: Add `calcTools` to two documents in `documents.ts`

Find the document with `id: "performance-eval-plan"` and add `calcTools: ["sens-spec", "sample-size"],` to it.
Find the document with `id: "risk-management-plan"` and add `calcTools: ["risk-matrix"],` to it.

## Step 3: Modify `src/components/DocumentWorkspace.tsx`

Read the file. Make these changes:

**Add 3 imports** after the existing component imports (after the line importing `EffortTimeline`):
```tsx
import { SensSpecCalc } from "./calcs/SensSpecCalc";
import { SampleSizeCalc } from "./calcs/SampleSizeCalc";
import { RiskMatrixCalc } from "./calcs/RiskMatrixCalc";
```

**Add calc widget section** — find the comment `{/* 본문 2열 */}` in DocumentWorkspace and INSERT the following BEFORE it:

```tsx
{/* 계산 도구 */}
{doc.calcTools && doc.calcTools.length > 0 && (
  <div style={{ marginBottom: "var(--s-6)" }}>
    <h2 className="font-bold text-text" style={{ fontSize: "var(--t-xl)", marginBottom: "var(--s-3)" }}>
      내장 계산 도구
    </h2>
    {doc.calcTools.includes("sens-spec") && <SensSpecCalc />}
    {doc.calcTools.includes("sample-size") && <SampleSizeCalc />}
    {doc.calcTools.includes("risk-matrix") && <RiskMatrixCalc />}
  </div>
)}
```

## Step 4: Build check

Run `npm run build` from `C:\Users\redna\.claude\ivdr-wiki\`

If build fails due to TypeScript errors about `calcTools` not existing on DocTemplate, check that Step 1 was done correctly.

## Step 5: Commit

From `C:\Users\redna\.claude\`:
```
git add ivdr-wiki/src/data/documents.ts ivdr-wiki/src/components/DocumentWorkspace.tsx
git commit -m "feat(calcs): DocumentWorkspace에 계산 도구 통합"
```

